'''Sakura''' is an [[:Category:Uber Rare Cats|Uber Rare Cat]] that can be obtained by playing the [[Cat Capsule#Rare Capsule|Rare Capsule]] during the [[Street Fighter Collaboration Event/Blue Team Gacha Drop|Street Fighter Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 11.9 Update|Version 11.9]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 680
|rarity = UR
|name1 = Sakura
|name2 = Sakura CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Sakura CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
Sakura can be compared to [[Iz the Dancer (Uber Rare Cat)|Iz the Dancer]], but with much less usage due to her abysmal range. Though, if used correctly, she can easily take out enemies on the stages that best suit her, as having 100 piercing range helps her with reaching her target. Though, this piercing range shouldn't be relied too heavily on since her somewhat high knockback count can allow her to get easily get knocked back before she can use her DPS. Overall Sakura lacks the range to be viable in most load outs and late game stages, because of this she is practically a worse version of Luke (Despite both of them having two different niches,though both are quite mediocre) there's no point of pulling for sakura if you already own [[Luke (Uber Rare Cat)|Luke]]. She is quite the situational uber, she can strive if the conditions are right, but her lack of immunities really lowers her overall versatility/viability.

